# prek discovers nested .pre-commit-config.yaml files and installs their hooks,
# which is separate from the file `exclude` in .pre-commit-config.yaml. A vendored
# pybind11 config under thirdparty/geogram pins isort 5.10.1, whose Poetry metadata
# modern poetry-core refuses to build, so the static-checks job failed before it
# linted anything. Vendored trees are not ours to lint; the root config already
# says so for files.
thirdparty/
